{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/b41c14019061a15dd3b941bb048970ab.poster.avif?t=1761382436\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/b41c14019061a15dd3b941bb048970ab.webm?t=1761382436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/b41c14019061a15dd3b941bb048970ab.mp4?t=1761382436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fracture\u00a0</strong>is a fast-paced roguelike bullet-hell shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle enemies and bosses across ever-changing maps, collect items, unlock new ships, and upgrade your weapons!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High-Speed Bullet Hell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience intense, fast-paced battles filled with dazzling projectiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/612784ac57f0654e2b5f85554d763768.poster.avif?t=1761382436\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/612784ac57f0654e2b5f85554d763768.webm?t=1761382436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/612784ac57f0654e2b5f85554d763768.mp4?t=1761382436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrades &amp; Builds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to level up your ship and choose new abilities to create unique builds each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/63fbbd3bcef7f2958f7547d74c54f326.poster.avif?t=1761382436\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/63fbbd3bcef7f2958f7547d74c54f326.webm?t=1761382436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/63fbbd3bcef7f2958f7547d74c54f326.mp4?t=1761382436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock New Ships</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through waves to unlock new ships \u2014 each with distinct weapons and playstyles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ongoing Updates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More stages, ships, and improvements are coming with future updates (and bug fixes too)!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672110?t=1761382436","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672110?t=1761382436","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/7946838a75e387bd68e48ecd138528095a683507/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761382436","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/7946838a75e387bd68e48ecd138528095a683507/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761382436","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672110/extras/b41c14019061a15dd3b941bb048970ab.poster.avif?t=1761382436\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/